# Speech synthesis request sent to the afs_tts node.
#
# Request: A single CSV line formatted identically to the conversation history:
#   <role>,<recipient>,<type>,<text>,<voice>
# Prefixing with "[LEADER_RESPONSE]" indicates a response directed to the user.
# `delay` specifies the pause (in seconds) inserted before this utterance is spoken.
#
# Response: `success` only indicates that the request was accepted and enqueued.
# Callers learn that the utterance has actually finished playing via the
# `afs_tts_finished` topic, not from this response.
string text
float32 delay
---
bool success
